    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: SBQQ__ContractedPrice__c records past their expiration date that are still applying to new quotes.
Why it matters: Customers continue to get the old (typically lower) negotiated price after the contract should have rolled to standard pricing. Compounding revenue leakage that grows monthly.
Suppress a finding: when the contract was extended verbally and the date update is pending.
Disable the detector: only if expired contracted prices are intentionally honored. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
